---
import { ArrowRight, Building2, Wrench, ShieldCheck, MapPin, Sparkles, Star } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800" id="who-we-serve">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-teal/10 border border-brand-teal/30 text-brand-teal text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
        <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        <span>Tailored Digital Engineering</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
        Two Pathways. <span class="text-teal-700 dark:text-brand-teal italic font-light">One Standard of Authority.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="font-sans text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-4 font-light text-balance">
        Whether you are aligning multi-million dollar institutional coalitions or establishing regional dominance for your local craft, we engineer search and AI visibility built to last.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      {/* Track A: Institutional & Public-Private Partnerships */}
      <div
        class="rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-brand-teal/60 dark:hover:border-brand-teal/60 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl group"
        data-aos="fade-right"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium tracking-wider uppercase bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              Institutional Track
            </span>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-white flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
              <Building2 class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-teal" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold mb-3">
              Non-Profits & Public-Private Partnerships
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-700 dark:text-brand-teal font-mono">
              For Executive Directors, Foundations & Board Leaders
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
            Eliminate the 40% "Friction Tax" that hides your institutional impact. We untangle stakeholder misalignment, transform PDF information bloat into machine-readable assets, and position your mission as the primary authority for generative search and capital allocation.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-slate-400">Core Architecture:</div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal" />
                <span>The High-Stakes UX & Friction Audit</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal" />
                <span>Visibility-to-Velocity (V2V) Framework</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal" />
                <span>Institutional Knowledge Graph & AI Indexing</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-8">
          <a
            href="/services/HighStakesAudit"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-slate-900 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors group-hover:shadow-lg"
          >
            <span>Explore Institutional Infrastructure</span>
            <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Track B: Small Business & Regional Growth */}
      <div
        class="rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 bg-slate-900 text-white border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-brand-teal transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl group relative overflow-hidden"
        data-aos="fade-left"
        data-aos-delay="200"
      >
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid-pattern opacity-5 pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="space-y-6 relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium tracking-wider uppercase bg-brand-teal/20 text-brand-teal border border-brand-teal/30">
              Small Business Track
            </span>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-teal/10 text-brand-teal flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
              <Wrench class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-teal" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-white font-semibold mb-3">
              From Invisible to Indispensable
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-teal font-mono">
              For Master Craftsmen, Contractors & Local Service Firms
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-300 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
            You’ve spent years building an undeniable reputation with real-world craftsmanship and sleepless nights. Stop letting competitors with worse reviews bury you on page 7. We level the playing field so your community and AI search engines find you first.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800">
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-slate-400">Search Velocity Protocol:</div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <MapPin class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal" />
                <span>Google Map 3-Pack Regional Grounding</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <Star class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal" />
                <span>AI Search Engine (AEO) Citation Readiness</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal" />
                <span>Sub-Second Astro Web Architecture (&lt;0.8s)</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 relative z-10">
          <a
            href="/services/small-business-seo-aeo"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-brand-teal text-slate-950 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-brand-teal/90 transition-colors group-hover:shadow-lg shadow-brand-teal/20"
          >
            <span>Explore Small Business SEO & AEO</span>
            <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
